"hl-red\">创新点</span></li>\n          <li>你的研究有什么<span class=\"hl-red\">主要发现</span></li>\n          <li>此发现有何<span class=\"hl-red\">理论现实意义</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card c2\">\n        <div class=\"type\">类型二</div>\n        <div class=\"kw\">WHY</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>为什么选取这个<span class=\"hl-blue\">研究课题</span></li>\n          <li>为什么采取这个<span class=\"hl-blue\">研究方法</span></li>\n          <li>为什么运用这个<span class=\"hl-blue\">理论角度</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card c3\">\n        <div class=\"type\">类型三</div>\n        <div class=\"kw\">WHY NOT</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>为什么没有<span class=\"hl-green\">参考XX文献</span></li>\n          <li>为什么没有<span class=\"hl-green\">做XX测试</span></li>\n          <li>为什么没有<span class=\"hl-green\">考虑xx因素</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card c4\">\n        <div class=\"type\">类型四</div>\n        <div class=\"kw\">无言以对</div>\n        <ol>\n          <li>论文没有新意</li>\n          <li>讨论没有逻辑</li>\n          <li>遗漏重要文献</li>\n          <li>没有亮眼发现</li>\n          <li><span class=\"hl-red\">格式混乱</span></li>\n          <li><span class=\"hl-red\">漏洞百出</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"three-head\">\n      <div>感谢老师提问</div>\n      <div>复述问题要点</div>\n      <div>承认论文存在进步空间</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mid-body\">\n      <ul>\n        <li>理解/确认老师的<strong class=\"hl-red\">具体质疑点</strong></li>\n        <li>放缓问答节奏，为自己思考应对<strong class=\"hl-red\">创造时间</strong></li>\n        <li>消除和老师观点的对抗性，为进一步答辩<strong class=\"hl-red\">创造轻松氛围</strong></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"reply-cols\">\n      <div class=\"rcard r1\">\n        <div class=\"rtitle\">回复方式一<br>Elaboration</div>\n        <div class=\"rcn\">具体说明</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>针对问题once<br>开具体说明</li>\n          <li>结合PPT中提及具体内容</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rcard r2\">\n        <div class=\"rtitle\">回复方式二<br>Clarification</div>\n        <div class=\"rcn\">解释澄清</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>解释自己的<br>具体考虑</li>\n          <li>结合研究中的<br><span class=\"hl-blue\">合理局限</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rcard r3\">\n        <div class=\"rtitle\">回复方式三<br>Justification</div>\n        <div class=\"rcn\">论证说理</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>论证和老师分歧点的合理性</li>\n          <li>结合<span class=\"hl-blue\">前人研究</span><br>和自己的观点</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rcard r4\">\n        <div class=\"rtitle\">回复方式四<br>Appreciation</div>\n        <div class=\"rcn\">虚心接受</div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>老师指出论文核心问题</li>\n          <li><span class=\"hl-blue\">虚心接受诚恳感谢/修改</span></li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sum-head\">回顾总结</div>\n    <div class=\"sum-body\">\n      <ol>\n        <li>1. 总结回复的主要内容，突出“我的”考虑，“我的”研究亮点</li>\n        <li>2. 再次确认老师给出的建议，并表示已经认真记录</li>\n        <li>3. 提出<strong>简要修改思路</strong>，和老师口头沟通，后续会认真修改，谢谢老师</li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
